     }
    ],
    "note": "tail hair and rump behind the thighs (glTF z < -0.56; thigh skin ends at -0.54) carried 0.4 LeftUpLeg/RightUpLeg weight, so any thigh fold dragged the tail strands (Death belly-down fold tore 450 edges there)"
